# Separate experimental Python service (see adk-agent/README.md) — not part
# of this Dockerfile's build at all, but without this its .venv/ (~780 MB)
# gets pulled into this image's build context by `COPY . .`, bloating and
# slowing down the build of the actual deployed production service for no
# reason. Found by inspection while verifying deployability, not by a real
# build (Docker wasn't available to confirm empirically).
adk-agent
.features-gen
playwright-report
test-results
